  "calculation_notes": [
    "Section properties are transcribed from the dimensions and technical-characteristics tables in Savera Super Rev. 08/26; cm2, cm3, cm4 and cm values are converted to mm-based SI units.",
    "Profile c, h1 and f dimensions are taken only from the matching Savera profile row. Blank catalogue dimensions remain null and are not inferred.",
    "A 5 m nominal section is catalogue-confirmed. For this application, the displayed section count is ceil(travel height / 5 m) per rail line; it is not the count of parallel rails sharing load.",
    "The catalogue supports section geometry, unit mass, nominal stock length, process and speed-class checks. It does not establish the installed rail batch, actual profile orientation, rail-joint condition, support/bracket capacity, or complete lift conformity."
  ],
  "verification_status": "Current Savera Super catalogue data transcribed from manufacturer source. Profile mechanical ranges are preserved, but not substituted for EN 81-20 A5 or an installed-batch Rm/A5 pair because the catalogue does not identify the elongation test basis or trace a project batch.",
